-- examples/checks/demand-chain.rofl — demand_chain: A CLOSED RELATION ANSWERED ON
-- DEMAND is read from the store at any depth
-- (f_a_closed_recursion_on_a_bound_argument_met_the_depth_wall).
--
-- dc_u leaves Y free, so dc_h and dc_r read a relation answered on demand and are
-- answered on demand too; both are closed (every answer ground, every rule fires
-- bottom-up). `dc_r(Y) :- dc_e(X, Y), dc_r(X).` over a chain of 700 steps called
-- dc_r(699), dc_r(698), ... one inside the other, each a new call, and the depth
-- wall (512) cut the world: no dc_r past the first step was kept.
